{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_utage_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_utage_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "時髦把戲",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_utage_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "17ee75defd5f38c63a2dac82dcf769d3ddee47ab3be81945c1c523e26a1ef663",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_m"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴，你是知道我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每周，我都要去日落大道購物，去七分酒店喝下午茶，找幾處極好的風光拍照，周六的晚餐必須是東國料理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可現在，連最新款的芒果終端，我都是去借錢買的，而且，分期付款。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒錢了，親愛的，我的口袋和我的眼神一樣空蕩蕩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以“原始紛爭”裡就開始賣這種東西啦？架子上的這是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "極簡風的單肩包，時下流行的款式，在日落大道好賣到缺貨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你以前是說，這種樣式不就是枕頭套子加了根挎帶......唔，那個又是什麼？拖鞋嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "準確地來說，是潮流印花拖鞋。你不知道嗎？像你這麼大的年輕人都愛穿這種鞋子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順帶一提，印花是我自己設計的，參考融合了過去五年流行的印花樣式，有三種印花可供挑選，絕對夠潮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前的作品都去哪裡了呀？比如“性感獄卒風”，還有“暗黑女王風”呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就連你最滿意的“狂野叢林風”，我也只看到了幾頂帽子還在那邊......馱獸掛墜也不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些......都下架了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我以後還能從你這裡買到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "親愛的，我必須和過去說再見了。或許下次你來我能送你一個，但......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實話實說，我真的、真的很感謝你過去一直支持我的設計，陪我度過那些日子，我也很珍惜我的孩子們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是它們真的不好賣。特別是你離開龍門以後，只剩下那幾個熟客偶爾光顧，新客寥寥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最重要的是，我爸已經不給我錢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他不久前娶了個魯珀女人回家，之後就告訴我已經沒錢養我了。我必須自力更生，不然就得去睡大街。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在的我......沒辦法再和以前一樣，拿著我爸給我的錢，再拉上你去琢磨自己所謂的藝術品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你現在......有賺到錢嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前......還沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時間！相信我，我需要的是時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然高端市場還是“瑪爾特”和“0011”這些老品牌的天下，但是說到現在引領流行趨勢的，一定是大街小巷的潮牌店啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“極簡”“機能”“新復古”“街頭”......抓住流行，就是抓住未來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看看，我的這些都是最潮的，是符合消費者需求的寶貝，“真正的時尚”，而不是自詡為藝術的瞎胡鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面的銷量證明了它們能賣得多好，再加上我的才華......接下來一定會有人發現，這裡有更好的設計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且......我以新銳設計師的身份向春季潮流時尚展提交了參展申請，最近一直在做準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這次展會沒有高端品牌參與，大多是潮流設計，關注度卻很高，對我來說是個很好的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也不討厭那些大型時尚展啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“給自以為是的大人物們準備的表演，無能的設計師們想方設法得到權威的承認”......你以前可是這麼說的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在想想，嗯，也沒那麼不能接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那時候我還太年輕，而且也沒這麼缺錢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姿珍，我很認真地問你......你真的覺得，你的設計不如外面那些店裡賣的商品？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少他們能把東西賣出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好煩，事情又找上門來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再聊吧，姿珍，把那幾頂帽子都拿給我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還像以前一樣，八折？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，親愛的，現在店裡都不打折了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姿珍，也許做出改變對你來說真是個不錯的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，祝你在展會上有好的表現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時尚展嗎？很久沒有去過這樣的場合了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......似乎偶爾去看看也會很有意思呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "春季潮流時尚展，前一天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯......情報沒錯的話，應該是這裡。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位，一路順風。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽說了嗎？布蘭切爾先生要不是在設計中遇到了瓶頸，在各地尋找靈感，才不會參加這種有很多新人的展會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是知名設計師，談吐和舉止都那麼非同凡響。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著光鮮的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，你還想著他呀？反正明天的主題是社交，到時候再去陪他多喝幾杯就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "衣著華麗的女士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你瞎說什麼呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請留步，小姐，請出示邀請函。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說邀請函呀，哎呀，真不好意思，我趕來比較著急，忘記帶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，展前酒會是邀請制，沒有邀請函就不能進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，這樣呀......你知道我是誰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......一個穿得很潮流的學生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道布蘭切爾先生嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭切爾？那位著名的萊塔尼亞設計師？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呀，這一次他不是也來到酒會了嗎？偷偷告訴你，是主辦方特別邀請的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我確實看到他了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我跟你們講，這些知名藝術家脾氣可古怪了，又特別會使喚人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是他在龍門的助手，剛剛和他一起來的，但是布蘭切爾先生把一份很重要的設計稿忘在工作室裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不，我是幫他拿東西回來的，所以才沒有帶邀請函。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？為什麼我對你沒有任何印象？你有什麼證據？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，你可以和我一起去找布蘭切爾先生呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是如果打擾了布蘭切爾先生商談時的雅興......嗯，我可不知道會有什麼後果哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，你說對我沒有印象，那你記得剛剛離開的兩位女士嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，她們一個人穿著紅色的上衣，一個穿著深紫色的長裙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你根本沒有記住呀。她們明明一個人穿的是“瑪爾特”的秋季新品亮紫色開衫，一個人穿的是“時代”定製的紅色長裙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼可能？我的記憶一直都很好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你還記得布蘭切爾先生穿的是什麼顏色的衣服嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然！應該是......深灰色的禮服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，不......等等，我再想想，好像是黑色？也不對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，所以你對我沒有印象是理所當然的吧......啊，耽誤太長時間了，要是布蘭切爾先生發怒了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等......啊，為什麼剛好是換班的人去休息的時間！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣，你先進去給布蘭切爾先生送東西，我馬上進來確認。你，給我注意點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，多謝啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很簡單就混進來了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，下一步是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，在那邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您好，抱歉打擾了，布蘭切爾先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是從東國來到炎國留學的大學生，藝術史專業，兼職學校新聞社記者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是這樣的，我們最近正在做一項專欄，採訪與記錄多位當代知名藝術家的創作日常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是服裝設計界公認的大師，青年藝術從業者仰慕追隨的導師，也是我一直崇拜的偶像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好不容易您能來到龍門，這個千載難逢的機會，我就想著一定要在這次展會過程中採訪記錄一下您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請問，您可以給我這次機會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "採訪？我的日程中並沒有安排做這種事的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會耽誤您的日程，只要我能跟您去展會，在您身邊記錄就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子，你聽我說，我會專門花時間來到龍門，在這異國他鄉參加一群我連名字都認不上的人舉辦的時尚展——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是因為我正渴求著純粹的美麗......在如此神聖的事業中，我絕無陪大學生玩扮家家酒的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......等等，這場酒會你是怎麼進來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個呀。我和我叔叔提了一下，然後他給了我一封邀請函，我就進來啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他說要是我寫的稿子他滿意的話，就在老家舉辦專題時裝展，邀請各地的知名設計師參加，我就能再出一期專題啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您知道嗎？我們那裡的服飾可是相當獨特的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我當然知道！不就是東國......東國......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是採訪......我想想，如果你能保證不干擾我的日程，也不是完全沒有時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真、真的嗎？實在太感謝您了——那明天什麼時候......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "稍後我會讓我的助手把我的地址給你，明天早上九點到，你隨我去展會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "記住，我不喜歡人遲到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們見到剛剛進來的那個像大學生一樣的客人了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，保全先生，我在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......剛在和布蘭切爾先生說話？你真的是他的助手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還能騙你不成嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......抱歉，剛剛對你有所懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事呀，幸好你讓我進來了，布蘭切爾先生很滿意呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啦，有件......私人的事，想要問問你呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布蘭切爾先生呀，打算在龍門再多待幾日。但是這次他沒有帶隨身的保鏢，想要請一位龍門本地的、靠得住的保鏢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他把這件事交給我負責了，薪資非常豐厚哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，你們應該是主辦方在展會期間請來的臨時保全吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你工作做得那麼出色，有沒有接私活的打算呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這......我真的可以嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，還是需要一些基本的考察的。你懂的，走個過場......不如......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，就這一次展會的安全保衛工作，你和我講一講吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，客人，我們馬上就要關門了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，沒事，我隨便看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎下次光顧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她順階而下，直到雙腳踏實地面，忽地心思一動，回首望去。\n熟悉的小店裡，店員正在忙碌地撤下屬於過去的最後一樣擺件。\n她知道做完這些，店鋪將會煥然一新，光鮮亮麗。\n就像日落大道上那些霓虹滿目的時尚店一樣。\n許久不曾改變的舊招牌，閃爍了兩下後終於熄滅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bar_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈——老闆，再來一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姑娘，這都第三杯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工作壓力太大了，就得用酒來消遣嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多喝點，人才能忘掉那些麻煩事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前不是換了工作嗎？說是去到一家還不錯的設計師品牌店裡當店員，店名叫原什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“原始紛爭”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，那家店不是前段時間還上了時尚雜誌，推薦人據說是有名的藝術評論家“粉紅武士刀”老師。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "酒吧老闆",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一下子從寂寂無名的小店，搖身一變成了當紅店鋪，我老婆這兩天吵著要去逛逛呢，但我感覺那些衣服到處都差不多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，別提了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，您是......剛才來店裡的客人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姿珍她最近是在忙著為時尚展做準備吧，打理店鋪可辛苦你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是姿珍老師的朋友嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，算是吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......店裡倒是小事，畢竟應付顧客我還算在行，麻煩的......是給老師收拾倉庫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最近店裡的客人不是多了起來嗎，貨物也相應增多，以前的小倉庫不夠用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姿珍老師找人借了錢，租了一間新倉庫，要把之前的貨物都移過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倉庫裡堆了很多她奇思亂想的作品，收拾起來很煩心吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，姿珍老師之前親自打理的倉庫實在是太亂了，許多她過去的作品都雜亂地堆在一起，實在是太難整理了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "甚至......裡面還有床和生活用品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還在裡面住過好幾天呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前遇到了一場事故，不想讓人發現，借她的地方待了幾天......都是過去的事啦，不用在意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我花了好些天，才勉強將新貨物移走。現在只剩下老的作品還沒處理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看了老師以前的作品......要比現在的更有風格一些呢，也挺不錯的......不知道為什麼現在換了風格......嗝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不想了，嗝——認真幹活就夠了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看上去有點醉了哦，可不能再喝了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰、誰說的？我可沒醉，我酒量好得很呢！你看著啊！老闆，再來一杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，那是我小看你了。既然這樣，這杯我怎麼也得陪你喝掉啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惜我天生就酒精過敏，只能以柳橙汁代酒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係！喝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（看來是真喝醉了，連酒精過敏這種蹩腳藉口都能信，嘖嘖。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝！敬你的新生活，敬“原始紛爭”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬“原始紛爭”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊——好爽——就是......頭有點暈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，偷偷告訴你一件事，姿珍可有點神經大條。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前在老倉庫裡，她連倉庫鑰匙都要放在門板上，不然帶在身上出去一趟就會弄丟。以後還要麻煩你多照顧她啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我當然知道！她呀，現在已經改成把鑰匙壓在門前的石頭下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "店員",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總之，你放心，就包在我身上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就太感謝你啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哈欠）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，應該準備得差不多啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，已經開始期待明天的展會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她感覺手掌沁出了汗珠，捏了捏，把手伸進了口袋。\n再拿出來時，手掌中傳來一片冰冷的金屬觸感。\n一枚“狂野叢林風”的馱獸掛墜，靜靜地躺在掌心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看，這才叫可愛呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_uptown_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "春季潮流時尚展，當天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪裡哪裡，您客氣了。才稱不上是什麼青年才俊。不過是我運氣好，有幸得到了一些老師的青睞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有準備什麼驚喜啦，我還要跟各位前輩多多學習。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，失陪一下，我要去再檢查一下搭配造型。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_warehouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（多虧了那個大叔，進展會方便多了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（服裝雖然有點麻煩，還好已經搞定了，接下來是配飾，應該是存放在這裡的吧？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（發現目標！咦？還有兩個保全......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全甲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有沒有聽到頭上有什麼聲音？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全乙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全甲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽錯了嗎？不可能——啊！你幹什麼敲我腦袋？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全乙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥？誰沒事敲你？馬上模特們就要換衣服了，趕緊搬東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全甲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別裝蒜了！你手上拿的是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全乙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我手上——啊？我什麼時候把榔頭拿在手裡的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "倉庫保全甲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好哇你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿咻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "展會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噓——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "展會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼......突然出現在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "展會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我明白了，是陪布蘭切爾先生確認展前情況吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "展會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......布蘭切爾先生覺得我合適嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，你就放心吧，我都安排好啦。好好工作！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "展會保全",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行，我試試。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴？你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好呀，姿珍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道了，你是來這裡打探情報的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......說不好哦。總之我要走啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你別怪我。我知道你很喜歡我過去的設計，之後我會給你補償的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你一定要明白，我現在這麼做是有意義的，是身為設計師的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你喜歡玩樂，喜歡好看的東西，你的審美很好，我都知道，但是你依舊只是一個大學生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所做的事情的價值，你是不會明白的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，也許是你不懂哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "時尚這東西，並不一定是值得受人追捧的設計，不僅僅是被人追捧的設計會被稱為時尚哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然你現在認為你的東西需要別人的承認，才能成為所謂真正的時尚，那就讓他們見識一下好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉兩位，馬上展會就要開始了，後台即將清場，請二位回到座位上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，不掃你的興了，請好好享受......獨一無二的展會吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_manorindoor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性設計師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葉女士，我記得你的展出是新銳設計師組的第一個吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性設計師",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_175",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，揭幕出場，那可要讓我們這些老傢伙大開眼界了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（搖晃酒杯）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葉老師，葉姿珍老師！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我，請問......有什麼事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一件事想和您確認一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢點，你說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方才在後台準備的時候，發現您的展品和提交的單子上不一樣，一位自稱您助手的人說您為了更好的效果，臨時更換了展出作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼可能？！我都和造型總監交代過上身效果了！他難道看不出來服飾的問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是自稱您助手的人在後台和您交流的時候，我和總監都看到了，所以就......沒有懷疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道是......宴？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總監覺得能身處會場的人不可能有問題，而且因為這次主題是都市酒會，設計師要出席酒會，交給助手傳達修改意見也正常......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我還是有點不放心，想要和您確認一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "中止展出！給我中止展出！我要去後台！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工作人員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在......可能已經來不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士們，先生們，各位晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎大家在這個美好的夜晚相聚，參加我們的春季潮流時尚展。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "展會的第一部分將交給新銳設計師。青年設計師即設計的未來，他們的作品也將在這個舞台上大放光彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼首先登場的是，葉姿珍女士為本次展會帶來的全新作品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，葉姿珍女士還有點害羞，但其實葉女士非常用心地在準備這次新品展，為此她的助手還專門在我上台前給了我一張介紹詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“以薩爾貢的原始叢林為靈感，在粗獷的原始自然風格中尋覓生命力量，融入獨特的現代都市美學，構建出的原創服飾風格。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "主持人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_176",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“狂野叢林”系列新品，敬請欣賞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "液體般的閃亮燈光，流淌於原始粗獷的花紋之上，猶如自遙遠蠻荒向現代文明滴落的黃金。\n模特們仍舊擺出排練好的姿勢，誇張駭人的飾品竟在並不匹配的造型中散放出濃烈的魅力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主持人！等等！搞錯了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "停下！停下！不要再展示了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "完了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葉......葉女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這真的是你的作品嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "葉姿珍",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_032",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是我......不是，這是我過去隨便製作的廢棄設計！不是我要展出的作品！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多麼......多麼美妙，又充滿自然活力的創作啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原始與現代，自然與都市，竟然在這些服飾設計中形成了奇妙的和諧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在苦苦尋覓的，如孩童眼中的景象一般......不經雕琢的、純粹的美麗，竟然被你創造了出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布蘭切爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "葉姿珍女士！你做得太棒了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "儘管他的聲音並不大，但在場的所有人，都堅信自己清晰地聽見了這位知名設計師的評價。\n接著，掌聲陸續在會場各處響起，直到連成一片歡呼的海洋。\n葉姿珍退坐在椅子上，在嘈雜的喝彩聲中，她一句話也說不出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴！原來你在這裡呀，我找了你好一會呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "晚上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，你又新做了美甲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好看吧？這可是暗黑系的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，差點忘記要找你問的事了。你知道最近龍門忽然流行起來“狂野叢林”風格的服飾嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道嗎？就是在一場展會後突然火起來的，現在龍門大街小巷的潮牌店都在做這個風格的成衣和飾品呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還想問下你怎麼樣，畢竟你可是著名的“粉紅武士刀”老師......欸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個掛墜！就是“狂野叢林”系列的對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼說呢？這個系列的想法倒是挺有趣的，但是設計師本人，就有點無趣了。總的來說值得入手一兩件吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過它竟然能流行起來......嘖嘖，說不定只是一場意外呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然宴給出了好評，我就放心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "avg_201_moeshd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，聽說設計出這個風格的設計師品牌店，最近打八折促銷哦！宴感興趣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣呀，那——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "宴",
      "speakerId": "char_337_utage",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們就再去逛逛吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
